---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import '../styles/service-pricing.css';
const { development, consulting } = site.pricing;
---
<div class="service-price-pair">
  <article class="service-price service-price--development" aria-labelledby="development-title">
    <div class="service-price-heading"><div><p class="service-price-for">0円から、お店のWeb・アプリを。</p><h3 id="development-title">{development.name}</h3></div><Icon name="web" size={36} /></div>
    <p class="service-price-caption">初期費用</p><p class="service-price-number"><strong>{development.initialLabel}</strong><span>円（税込）</span></p>
    <div class="service-price-trial"><strong>合計0円で、1か月お試し。</strong><p>{development.firstMonth}</p></div>
    <p class="service-price-recurring"><span>2か月目から</span><strong>月額 {development.monthlyLabel}<small>円（税込）</small></strong></p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/pricing/#development">お試しと月額の詳しい案内</a>
  </article>
  <article class="service-price service-price--consulting" aria-labelledby="consulting-title">
    <div class="service-price-heading"><div><p class="service-price-for">お店の課題を相談するコンサル</p><h3 id="consulting-title">{consulting.name}</h3></div><Icon name="tools" size={36} /></div>
    <p class="service-price-caption">ヒアリング無料・製品の提供時にお支払い</p><p class="service-price-number"><strong>{consulting.feeLabel}</strong><span>円（税込）</span></p>
    <div class="service-price-refund"><strong>納品日から2週間以内、70％返金可。</strong><p>返金額 {consulting.refund.amountLabel}円。<br />残り{consulting.refund.retainedLabel}円は返金対象外です。</p></div>
    <p class="service-price-maintenance">製品によって別途維持費がかかります。<br />改良・改善のための費用を、事前にご案内します。</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/pricing/#consulting">提供内容・返金条件の詳しい案内</a>
  </article>
</div>
